# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Format: /old-path  /new-path  [status]
# SEO gate (Phase 5): map every existing verobeachadultmedicine.com URL before DNS cutover.
# Existing site has regional landing pages — audit traffic, then add redirects here.

# Short, memorable URLs for phone tree, business cards, and verbal reference.
# Canonical pages stay where they are; these are 301 aliases.
/register   /for-patients/new-patient-registration/   301

# Campaign short links — QR codes and print signage.
# 302 (not 301) so the destination and UTM tags stay repointable after the
# campaign; a 301 would be cached in scanners' browsers indefinitely.
#
# Use utm_* only. The click-ID capture (PR #16) reads the standard utm_* keys
# and persists them, so those reach the Jotform submission. A non-standard
# `source` key is NOT captured and would be silently dropped — name campaigns
# with utm_campaign instead.
#
# Labor Day Bash 2026 — table signage / handout QR code. Event has passed;
# kept as the worked example of the pattern. Safe to prune once the printed
# assets are out of circulation.
/laborday   /for-patients/new-patient-registration/?utm_source=labor-day-bash&utm_medium=qr-code&utm_campaign=labor-day-2026   302
/laborday/  /for-patients/new-patient-registration/?utm_source=labor-day-bash&utm_medium=qr-code&utm_campaign=labor-day-2026   302

